    "sections": {
        "description": "The Interior Design theme is a stylish, modern, and fully responsive theme created specifically for interior designers, decorators, and design consultancies. It serves as the perfect digital portfolio for showcasing interior design projects—from home interiors and modular kitchens to office interiors and commercial spaces. Built for interior consultants, architecture firms, and decor studios, this theme offers an intuitive layout that puts design visuals front and center. Designed with elegance and usability in mind, the Interior Design theme highlights key areas like living room ideas, bedroom design, kitchen interiors, and home makeovers. Whether you focus on rustic design, Scandinavian style, boho interiors, or luxury interiors, the theme allows you to display your creative vision through visually rich galleries, interior blocks, and modern layouts. Its benefits include fast-loading pages, compatibility with drag-and-drop builders, and SEO optimization to boost your online visibility. Showcase testimonials, create style moodboards, and publish blogs on decor trends, furnishing ideas, or compact space solutions. With pre-designed templates for residential, commercial, and hospitality design, the theme enables decor professionals to inspire clients with design ideas and interior styling tips. It’s ideal for design studios, freelancers, or agencies aiming to make a bold, creative impression in the world of interiors. Related search terms include: interior design portfolio, home decor website, architecture design, modular kitchen design, minimalist home, home improvement blog, contemporary interiors, industrial interiors, classic interior style, furniture design, home renovation, real estate staging, and decor blog. The theme supports Contact Form 7 plugin, enabling seamless communication with potential clients through elegant and functional contact forms."
    },
